  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Bananas, Beneficiaries: 119 Banana Farmers, USADF support will enable the group obtain training and technical assistance to improve its technical, financial and organizational management capacity, and renovate priority elements of the production system to increase production and income and develop a longer term strategy to revitalize the plantation.</narrative>
